# OpenGoldBox C++ style: docs/CODING/_STYLE.md
# Validated with clang-format 23.1.0, LLVM revision:
# ea7d852a70e8bdfaf601d6626a760f9771b2c4b4 (VS Code C/C++ bundled binary).
# Required braces, naming, and ownership rules are checked separately in review.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++20
IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
ColumnLimit: 100
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLambdasOnASingleLine: None
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
SortIncludes: Never
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
